0x142e88290	Car_Spline_EvalObfuscated	-	L1	car	float(void *spline, float x)	decomp:re/decomp/142e88290.c	Evaluates a physics spline whose numbers are stored XOR-obfuscated: each float is (u32 at +o) ^ (u32 at +o+8). Uniform mode (count +0x90 >= 0): index = x*scale(+0x60^+0x68) + offset(+0x70^+0x78), 16-byte samples from +0x98 (value ^ +0xa0), clamped and lerped. Point mode (count < 0): 32-byte points in [+0x8,+0x10), x = +0^+8, y = +0x10^+0x18, lerped. Used for VTF splines (engine, aero, tyres) at runtime; memory edits of handling values must keep the XOR pairing. No signature: the generated pattern fails sigcheck.
